            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0-beta5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<div class="markdown-heading"><h3 class="heading-element">What's Changed</h3><a id="user-content-whats-changed" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: What's Changed" href="#whats-changed"><span aria-hidden="true" class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a></div>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>UI</strong>: Fix Chat 'Beta' badge clipping in notch tab header by fitting it within visible tab bounds.</li>
<li>
<strong>UI</strong>: Add 'Beta' badge to Chat across Settings sidebar, Bundled modules list, detail view title, and Onboarding.</li>
<li>
<strong>Performance</strong>: Fix Fan Control auto-ramp loop that repeatedly executed <code>smc-helper</code> forced mode writes below threshold, eliminating ~250ms main thread blocking spikes.</li>
<li>
<strong>Performance</strong>: Re-enable WebKit DOM timer throttling and process suppression for inactive chat tabs, reducing idle CPU from 30–50% down to 0%.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
